  "given": {"O": "The centre of an octagon.", "A": "The centre of the next motif along the grid, a cross."},
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Rule a horizontal line through O and A and draw a circle about O through A. A star will sit at O, at A and at every point of the square grid one radius apart.",
      "create": {"c": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "A"}}, "h": {"line": {"through": ["O", "A"]}}},
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Rule the vertical through O. At the four points where the circle meets the two lines, rule lines at right angles to them: they meet at the corners of the tile, where more octagons sit. Rule the two diagonals through O and the corners.",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "Rule the vertical through O. Where the circle meets the two lines, rule lines at right angles to them on the left, the right and the top: they meet at the corners of the tile, where more octagons sit (the bottom side is not needed). Rule the two diagonals through O and the corners.",
      "create": {
        "v": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "P90": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "P180": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "P270": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270.0}}},
        "gx": {"line": {"through": "A", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "gxw": {"line": {"through": "P180", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "gy": {"line": {"through": "P90", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "gys": {"line": {"through": "P270", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "K": {"point": {"meet": ["gx", "gy"]}},
        "K2": {"point": {"meet": ["gxw", "gy"]}},
        "K3": {"point": {"meet": ["gxw", "gys"]}},
        "K4": {"point": {"meet": ["gx", "gys"]}},
        "d45": {"line": {"through": ["O", "K"]}},
        "d135": {"line": {"through": ["O", "K2"]}}
      },
      "highlight": ["c", "h"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Halve OA: draw the circle about A through O, and join the two points where it crosses the first circle. Where that line meets the horizontal is the midpoint M. Draw the circle about O through M: the circle of the star at O.",
      "create": {
        "cA": {"circle": {"centre": "A", "through": "O"}},
        "W1": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "cA"], "pick": {"angle": 60.0}}},
        "W2": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "cA"], "pick": {"angle": 300.0}}},
        "mid": {"line": {"through": ["W1", "W2"]}},
        "M": {"point": {"meet": ["mid", "h"]}},
        "cs": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "M"}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Mark the eight points where this circle meets the horizontal, the vertical and the diagonals. Join each point to the one three places round: an eight-pointed star. Join each point to its neighbour too: the octagon round the star.",
