      "text": "The star at A has a cross at its centre. Open the compass to a side of its octagon, put it on the star’s point M and mark inwards along the horizontal: the mark N is as far from A as the cross’s notches. Draw the circle about A through N; it marks the four notches on the horizontal and the vertical.",
